  "label": "Provocative Glamour Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme uses the visual of a woman styled in a provocative and glamorous manner to represent Auburn University fans. This aesthetic is a stereotype that reduces the identity of the fan group to superficial or objectified imagery, which is a form of cultural caricature. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the meme's mocking intent.",
